01:03:27.408 --> 01:03:29.376
- How about a shiner, superstar?
DUSTIN: Oh, no.


01:03:29.543 --> 01:03:32.706
Won't be no bruising the moneymaker,
okay?


01:03:32.880 --> 01:03:36.213
You broke my best friend's heart.
Have a nice life.


01:03:36.383 --> 01:03:39.477
- Tami, I don't even know what I did wrong.
- Let me handle this, JP.


01:03:39.653 --> 01:03:41.712
He doesn't even know
what he did wrong.


01:03:41.889 --> 01:03:43.083
I just said that.


01:03:43.257 --> 01:03:45.225
I know, but it's all about
your intonation.


01:03:45.392 --> 01:03:48.225
Hey. She knows you cheated. Get it?


01:03:48.395 --> 01:03:51.922
- You're done.
- What? That's crazy. And not true.


01:03:52.600 --> 01:03:55.398
That's funny, because she saw you
with Natalia.


01:03:57.938 --> 01:03:59.200
Wait a second, hold on.


01:03:59.373 --> 01:04:03.002
So Mary was there
when Natalia broke into your house?


01:04:03.177 --> 01:04:04.701
No. No, nothing happened.


01:04:05.779 --> 01:04:08.475
Natalia busted into my parents' house.
She set me up.


01:04:09.116 --> 01:04:11.311
There's nothing going on between us.


01:04:11.485 --> 01:04:13.419
I would never hurt Mary like that.


01:04:14.221 --> 01:04:15.984
This is insane.
You have to believe me.


01:04:16.156 --> 01:04:19.023
Look, I want to believe you
and I want her to be happy.


01:04:19.193 --> 01:04:21.957
Especially now that she's stuck
with Dominique another year.


01:04:22.129 --> 01:04:24.256
Wait, she didn't get into Manhattan?


01:04:24.431 --> 01:04:27.366
- They didn't give her the audition.
- Oh, my God.


01:04:27.535 --> 01:04:30.834
