01:20:54.020 --> 01:20:56.614
<i>Bring the beat back once more</i>


01:20:56.789 --> 01:20:58.313
- <i>Let me see you do that</i>
- <i>Let me see you do that</i>


01:20:58.491 --> 01:21:00.391
<i>You're the new classic</i>


01:21:00.560 --> 01:21:02.926
- <i>You're the new P. Y.T.</i>
- <i>You're the new P. Y.T.</i>


01:21:03.096 --> 01:21:04.825
- <i>Stands for pretty, young</i>
- <i>Stands for pretty, young</i>


01:21:04.998 --> 01:21:07.558
- <i>You take a chance to believe in me</i>
- <i>You take a chance to believe in me</i>


01:21:07.734 --> 01:21:10.362
- <i>You're the new classic, fantastic</i>
- <i>You're the new classic, fantastic</i>


01:21:10.537 --> 01:21:12.164
- <i>Now you own this floor</i>
- <i>Now you own this floor</i>


01:21:12.338 --> 01:21:14.306
- <i>Bring the beat back once more</i>
- <i>Bring the beat back once more</i>


01:21:14.974 --> 01:21:17.340
- <i>And watch us while we do that</i>
- <i>And watch us while we do that</i>


01:21:17.544 --> 01:21:19.535
[CROWD CHEERING]


01:21:20.246 --> 01:21:21.543
[SPEAKING INDISTINCTLY]


01:21:26.352 --> 01:21:27.717
DUSTIN:
Yeah.


01:21:27.887 --> 01:21:29.377
- All right, Mary!
- Yeah.


01:21:29.556 --> 01:21:31.524
You're showing off, Mary.


01:21:31.691 --> 01:21:33.716
Stop showing off.


01:21:53.580 --> 01:21:55.275
All right.


01:21:55.548 --> 01:21:58.881
Thank you. Check it out. I'm gonna let
the judges over there deliberate.


01:21:59.052 --> 01:22:01.077
And I'll be back in five short minutes...


01:22:01.254 --> 01:22:04.155
...with the name of our winner.
Make some noise.


01:22:05.858 --> 01:22:08.224
Mary, you...


01:22:08.394 --> 01:22:10.225
You were amazing.


01:22:11.331 --> 01:22:13.128
So were you.


01:22:14.167 --> 01:22:17.136
No, no. There's nothing going on
between me and Natalia, okay?


01:22:17.303 --> 01:22:20.534
I was ambushed.
I was set up by your stepsisters.


01:22:21.841 --> 01:22:23.536
I would never hurt you like that.


01:22:25.278 --> 01:22:27.576
Believe me, okay?


01:22:27.981 --> 01:22:30.381
And no matter what they do...


01:22:32.285 --> 01:22:34.378
...we were meant to be together.


01:22:44.497 --> 01:22:47.398
- I believe you.
- Good. Because I'm totally kissable.


01:22:47.567 --> 01:22:49.228
[LAUGHS]


01:22:50.603 --> 01:22:52.230
[SPEAKING INDISTINCTLY]


01:22:57.076 --> 01:22:58.100
That's my cue.


01:22:58.878 --> 01:23:01.142
- Go.
- Okay.


01:23:04.584 --> 01:23:06.609
Everybody still here?


01:23:06.819 --> 01:23:09.117
No, no, no, I can't hear you. Come on.


01:23:09.288 --> 01:23:10.949
[CHEERING]


01:23:14.027 --> 01:23:17.963
Everybody that came out tonight, dancers.
Thank you so much. You're amazing.


01:23:18.131 --> 01:23:20.156
I love you.


01:23:20.733 --> 01:23:24.567
But there can only be one winner.
I have that name in my hand. Here we go.


01:23:25.104 --> 01:23:27.368
The winner of the competition...


01:23:28.074 --> 01:23:29.507
...is...


01:23:30.710 --> 01:23:34.111
- Oh, my God. Mary Santiago.
- What?


01:23:37.750 --> 01:23:39.775
JOEY:
Everybody give it up.


01:23:41.454 --> 01:23:43.285
- Yeah.
- Yeah.


01:23:47.126 --> 01:23:49.253
No, it's fixed. What, you rig it, Mary?


01:23:51.998 --> 01:23:53.090
La-la-la.


01:23:53.433 --> 01:23:55.628
- You're amazing.
- Hey.


01:23:55.802 --> 01:23:58.293
This isn't fair. I deserve this award.


01:24:00.707 --> 01:24:02.698
But you were really good, Mary.


01:24:04.610 --> 01:24:06.373
TAMI: Hey.
- Aah!


01:24:07.346 --> 01:24:09.280
DUSTIN:
Congratulations.


01:24:09.449 --> 01:24:12.077
Look, hey, those moves were so
redonkulous, Mary.


01:24:12.251 --> 01:24:14.310
And I have to say, Joey,
as your manager...


01:24:14.487 --> 01:24:17.547
...I have to say
I think you got your swagger back.


01:24:17.724 --> 01:24:19.214
DOMINIQUE: Move it.
- Oh.


01:24:19.392 --> 01:24:21.223
How dare you?


01:24:21.861 --> 01:24:26.491
How dare you embarrass me
and your sisters?


01:24:26.666 --> 01:24:29.658
How do you think
this makes us look, huh?


01:24:30.069 --> 01:24:33.561
You, our maid,
wins the Joey Parker competition?


01:24:33.740 --> 01:24:39.872
You have humiliated us in front
of the entire Los Angeles metropolitan area.


01:24:41.080 --> 01:24:43.708
Miss Santiago?
My name is Regina Cretikos.


01:24:43.883 --> 01:24:45.475
I'm with the Manhattan Academy.


01:24:46.486 --> 01:24:50.183
You danced spectacularly well
for someone with two broken legs.


01:24:51.991 --> 01:24:55.188
Wait. What do you mean,
two broken legs?


01:24:55.361 --> 01:24:56.623
Don't look at me like that.


01:24:56.796 --> 01:24:59.663
We'll talk about this later.
Don't you pull that face with me.


01:24:59.832 --> 01:25:01.595
Girls, come with me.


01:25:01.768 --> 01:25:03.201
[SCREAMS]


01:25:08.141 --> 01:25:09.608
[GROANING]


01:25:11.511 --> 01:25:12.910
Anyway...


01:25:13.079 --> 01:25:15.877
...we would be honored
if you would come study with us.


01:25:16.048 --> 01:25:19.540
- Full scholarship. Call me on Monday.
- Oh, my God.


01:25:20.119 --> 01:25:22.280
It worked, man.


01:25:29.428 --> 01:25:32.955
Britt? I seem to have broken things.


01:25:35.768 --> 01:25:36.757
Hello?


01:25:37.036 --> 01:25:38.628
TAMI:
Call me every day, okay?


01:25:38.805 --> 01:25:41.239
I don't know if I can handle senior year
without you.


01:25:41.407 --> 01:25:43.898
Give it a few months,
you'll pick me up in your jet.


01:25:44.076 --> 01:25:45.976
- And we'll go shopping in Paris.
- Okay.


01:25:46.145 --> 01:25:47.908
DOMINIQUE:
I need my meds.


01:25:48.080 --> 01:25:50.776
P-R-O-N-T-O, pronto.


01:25:50.950 --> 01:25:53.578
Mary, did you hear me?


01:25:53.753 --> 01:25:56.415
Not the OxoCollon, that's for breakfast.


01:25:56.589 --> 01:25:58.989
I need my morphine, it's lunch time.


01:25:59.158 --> 01:26:01.023
Mary. Come on.


01:26:01.194 --> 01:26:03.822
Mary. A little help here, please.


01:26:05.565 --> 01:26:08.159
Sorry, Dominique.
I don't work for you anymore.


01:26:08.935 --> 01:26:10.960
- Oh, come on.
- Hey.


01:26:11.137 --> 01:26:15.335
Mary, aren't we BFFFFs or...?
Isn't that what the kids say?


01:26:15.508 --> 01:26:17.772
I can't believe all my dreams
are coming true.


01:26:17.944 --> 01:26:19.605
DOMINIQUE:
I know I can be a witch.


01:26:19.779 --> 01:26:21.474
You shouldn't be so sensitive.


01:26:21.647 --> 01:26:23.911
Don't you dare get in that van, Mary.


01:26:24.283 --> 01:26:25.341
Mary?


01:26:25.518 --> 01:26:28.510
Mary, don't leave me with these people.


01:26:28.688 --> 01:26:30.952
Don't be my frienemy!


01:26:31.123 --> 01:26:33.114
[GASPING]


01:26:33.292 --> 01:26:35.624
Oh, I'm feeling something.


01:26:36.062 --> 01:26:38.007
I'm feeling
abandoned.


01:26:47.740 --> 01:26:48.832
[CROWD CHEERING]


01:26:49.008 --> 01:26:50.032
Shh.


01:26:52.078 --> 01:26:53.636
[DANCE MUSIC PLAYING]


01:29:13.352 --> 01:29:15.343
[CROWD CHEERING]


01:32:00.886 --> 01:32:02.877
Subtitles by LeapinLar

